WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,320
What's wrong? Yuyue is burned.

2
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:13,540
Fish Moon wants to eat this braised pork made by dad

3
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,790
Your dad made it for you

4
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:22,940
What does it mean to prepare so much?

5
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:25,100
Afraid that we will starve the fish moon

6
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,100
I brought them all back. It would be a waste not to eat them.

7
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:40,020
Heat one up first. It tastes really good.
